# Practice › Easy hills: drive, pause, Undo (back to the last two-second snapshot, which resumes the
# run), then drive on to the flag.
until 300 Hillwheel
frames 150
click Practice. Pick a hill type
until 60 Easy hills
frames 10
click =Easy hills
until 120 m to the flag
hold KeyW
frames 420
release KeyW
key Escape 2
until 60 =Undo
frames 10
save practice-paused
click =Undo
frames 30
hold KeyW
until 1500 Finished!
release KeyW
frames 20
save practice-results
